Third-party assets bundled with this theme keep their own licenses:

- Figtree (public/fonts/figtree) — SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  See public/fonts/figtree/LICENSE.txt.
- Bootstrap Icons (src/icons/bootstrap) — MIT License.
  See src/icons/bootstrap/LICENSE.md.
- Demo issue images in src/content/issues are from Pexels under the Pexels
  License and are credited in each issue's frontmatter. Replace them with your
  own images before publishing.
- Demo writer portraits in src/assets/writers are Unsplash placeholders. The
  people photographed have no connection to these fictional bylines, so swap
  in photos of your real contributors before publishing.
